{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/paths/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/paths/", "title": "Core Paths", "content_html": "<p>Each core looks for its games in a folder named after the core. This page lists where that folder can be, and which location is used if it exists in more tha...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/paths.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core is the most feature-filled and heavily developed core so far:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region s...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>The Sega Saturn MiSTer core, originally developed by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank}, is a suitable modern replac...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>The Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) MiSTer core has many features, such as CPU and Super FX turbo modes, lightgun and mouse support, and a configu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "title": "TurboGrafx-16", "content_html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/TurboGrafx16_MiSTer\">MiSTer TurboGrafx16 core</a>{target=_blank} is an extremely accurate TurboGrafx-16 / PC-Engine impleme...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/tgfx16.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/paths/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/paths/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30d1\u30b9", "content_html": "<p>\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u540d\u3068\u540c\u3058\u540d\u524d\u306e\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u63a2\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u305d\u306e\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u3092\u7f6e\u3051\u308b\u5834\u6240\u3068\u3001\u8907\u6570\u5b58\u5728\u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304c\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u308b\u304b\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u6a19\u6e96\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u30d1\u30b9</h2>\n<p><code>/media/fat/games/&lt;CORE&gt;</code> \u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u3059\u3002<code>&lt;CORE&gt;</code> \u306f\u305d\u306e\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306e[\u5185\u90e8\u30b3\u30a2\u540d](../develo...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/paths.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>Sony PlayStation\uff08PSX\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u3053\u308c\u307e\u3067\u3067\u6700\u3082\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u5145\u5b9f\u3057\u3001\u958b\u767a\u3082\u6d3b\u767a\u306a\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3059\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u8c4a\u5bcc\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</li>\n<li>BIOS \u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u81ea\u52d5\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048</li>\n<li>\u624b\u52d5\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u305f\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c92\u30b9\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8</li>\n<li>\u9ad8\u901f\u5316\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9</li>\n<li>\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30c6\u30af\u30b9\u30c1\u30e3\u5909\u66f4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PSX ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>Sega Saturn \u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank} \u6c0f\u304c\u958b\u767a\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3001Sega Saturn \u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u5927\u591a\u6570\u306b\u304a\u3044\u3066\u5b9f\u6a5f\u306b\u4ee3\u308f\u308b\u73fe\u4ee3\u7684\u306a\u9078\u629e\u80a2\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>Super Nintendo Entertainment System\uff08SNES\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u306f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002CPU \u3068 Super FX \u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30c8\u30ac\u30f3\u30fb\u30de\u30a6\u30b9\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u306a WRAM \u521d\u671f\u5316\u5024\u306a\u3069\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u62e1\u5f35\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u307b\u307c\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306b\u3082\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u5f37\u529b\u306a\u30b3...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/tgfx16/", "title": "TurboGrafx-16", "content_html": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/TurboGrafx16_MiSTer\">MiSTer TurboGrafx16 \u30b3\u30a2</a>{target=_blank}\u306f\u3001\u6975\u3081\u3066\u6b63\u78ba\u306a TurboGrafx-16 / PC-Engine \u5b9f\u88c5\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5143\u306f [Gregory \"Torlus\" Estr...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/tgfx16.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:58:19+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/arcade_video/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/arcade_video/", "title": "sys - arcade_video", "content_html": "<p><code>arcade_video</code> is used mostly in arcade cores. It provides helpers to optionally enable the scandoubler (based on ini settings), handle rotation on HDMI, and...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/arcade_video.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "title": "Core Configuration String", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer provides an on-screen display (OSD) that can be toggled on and off by pressing F12 on your keyboard (or OSD button). For each core that is loaded, thi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/conf_str.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "title": "overview of emu module", "content_html": "<p>On MiSTer, the top level is inside <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer/blob/master/sys/sys_top.v\">sys/sys_top.v</a>{target=_blank}. When writing or...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/emu.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/hps_io/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/hps_io/", "title": "sys - hps_io", "content_html": "<p>HPS stands for Hard Processor System \u2014 the ARM part of the MiSTer FPGA. The <code>hps_io.sv</code> file contains the <code>hps_io</code> module, which talks to the MiSTer binary o...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/hps_io.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "title": "Arcade ROMS and MRA Files", "content_html": "<p>This page explains most of the intricacies of the way MiSTer handles ROMs for Arcade systems.</p>\n<h2>MRA Format</h2>\n<p>Because some arcade boards can change games by ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/porting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/porting/", "title": "Porting Cores", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer uses quite complex hardware, but thanks to open source, developers with different levels of hardware and software knowledge can develop for the platfo...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/porting.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/savestates/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/savestates/", "title": "Savestates", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer defines a special API for fast savestate saving and loading. Enabling the savestate functionality on your core reserves a developer-specified section ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/savestates.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/arcade_video/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/arcade_video/", "title": "sys - arcade_video", "content_html": "<p><code>arcade_video</code> \u306f\u4e3b\u306b\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30b9\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30c0\u30d6\u30e9\u30fc\u306e\u6709\u52b9\u5316\uff08ini \u8a2d\u5b9a\u306b\u57fa\u3065\u304f\uff09\u3001HDMI \u3067\u306e\u56de\u8ee2\u51e6\u7406\u3001\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u30ac\u30f3\u30de\u3084\u7570\u306a\u308b\u8272\u5e45\u306e\u51e6\u7406\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u30d8\u30eb\u30d1\u30fc\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>arcade_video \u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u5316</h2>\n<p>\u6b21\u306e\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u3067\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>WIDTH ...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/arcade_video.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/conf_str/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/conf_str/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u8a2d\u5b9a\u6587\u5b57\u5217", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306e F12\uff08\u307e\u305f\u306f OSD \u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\uff09\u3067\u30c8\u30b0\u30eb\u3067\u304d\u308b\u30aa\u30f3\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\uff08OSD\uff09\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307e\u308c\u305f\u30b3\u30a2\u3054\u3068\u306b\u3001\u3053\u306e\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u306b\u305d\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u5c02\u7528\u306e\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u8ffd\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u306f <code>emu</code> \u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306f <code>emu</code> \u304c\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306e\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30ec...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/conf_str.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/emu/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/emu/", "title": "emu\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u6982\u8981", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u3067\u306f\u3001\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u306f <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer/blob/master/sys/sys_top.v\">sys/sys_top.v</a>{target=_blank} \u5185\u306b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u3092\u66f8\u304f\u30fb\u79fb\u690d\u3059\u308b\u3068\u304d\u3001Quartu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/emu.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T12:44:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}